      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi Abalama ne bidimu makumi tshitema ne tshitema, Yehowa wakamueneka kudi Abalama, wakamuambila ne, Ndi Nzambi wa Bukole Buonso, wenda ku mpala kuanyi, wikale muakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenja dike tshihungidi tshianyi hankatshi hetu nʼebe, nenkukumbashe ba bu ngi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalama wakadia mpala hanshi, ne Nzambi wakayikila nʼandi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, tshihungidi tshianyi tshidi nʼebe, wewe newikale nkambua wa bisamba bia bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabena babikila kabidi dina diebe ne, Abalama, kadi nebakuidike dina diebe ne, Abalahama, bualu bua nakakuvuisha nkambua wa bisamba bia bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkuvudishangane ba bungi, nenkuvuishe bisamba bia bungi, bakelenge nebaledibue munda muebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenjadike tshihungidi tshianyi hankatshi hetu hebe ne tunkanunuina tuebe to ne bikondo biatu bionso bu tshihungidi tshia tshiendelele, bua meme kuikala Nzambi webe ne wa tunkanunuina tuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkuhe wewe ne tunkanunuina tuebe buloba buonso bua Kanana bûdi wendakanamu, bu buhianyi buenu bua tshiendelele, nengikale Nzambi wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakambila Abalahama ne, Wewe ne tunkanunuina tuebe mu bikondo biatu bionso, nenutumikile tshihungidi tshianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etshi ntshihungidi tshidi hankatshi hetu nʼebe ne tunkanunuina tuebe tshinudi nʼatshi bua kutumikila ne, Muana mulume yonso wa munkatshi muenu atengudibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebanutengule, ne bualu ebu nebuikale bu tshimanyinu tshia tshihungidi tshidi hankatshi hetu nʼebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana mulume wa munkatshi muenu, hafikeye matuku muanda mukulu, neatengudibue, muana mulume yonso wa ku bikondo bienu bionso, yeye udi muledibue mu nsubu wenu, anyi yeye udibo basumba kudi ba bende ku argent, udi kayi kankanunuina kebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye udi muledibue mu nsubu webe ne yeye udibo basumba ku argent webe udi ne bua kutengudibua, tshi hungidi tshianyi netshikale munda muenu bu tshihungidi tshia tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu mulume udi kayi mutengula nebamumushe munkatshi mua bana babo, bualu bua yeye wakashiha tshihungidi tshianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakambila Abalahama ne, Kabena babikila mukashi webe, Salai kabidi, nebamubikile ne, Sala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemmuvudishile di sanka, yeye neakulelele muana mulume, nemmusankishe bulelela, yeye neikale nkambua wa bisamba bia bungi, ne bakelenge ba bantu nebaluhuke munda muandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Abalahama wakadishinda hanshi, wakaseka, wakamba mu mu tshima wandi ne, Nebalelele muntu udi ne bidimu lukama muana, anyi? Sala udi ne bidimu makumi tshitema nealele, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakambila Nzambi ne, Mbimpe Yishemaele ikale ne muoyo ku mesu kuebe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakamba ne, Nansha, Sala mukashi webe neakulelele muana wewe neumuidike dina ne, Isaka, nenjadike nʼandi yeye ne tunkanunuma tuandi tshihungidi tshianyi bu tshihungidi tshia tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakukunvuila bualu bua Yishemaele kabidi, mona, nakumusankisha, nemmukumbashe, nemmuvuishe bisamba bia bungi, yeye nealele baminyampala dikumi ne babidi, nemmuvuishe tshisamba tshinene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nenjadike tshihungidi tshiandi ne Isaka, wakulelela Sala tshidimu tshialua hakumbana ngondo yandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakalekela kuyikila ne Abalahama, wakamushiya, wakaya mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakangata Yishemaele, muanʼandi mulume, ne bana bonso bakaledibua mu nsubu wandi, ne bantu bonso bakasumbibua ku argent yandi, bantu balume bonso ba mu nsubu wa Abalahama bakatengudibua dituku adi mene bu muakamuambila Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakadi ne bidimu makumi tshitema ne tshitema hakamutengulabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishemaele, muanʼandi mulume, wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne bisatu hakamutengulabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama ne Yishemaele, muanʼandi mulume, bakatengudibua dituku dimue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balume bonso ba mu nsubu wandi, baledibue mu nsubu wandi, ne basumbibue ku argent kudi ba bende, bakatengudibua nʼandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
